nt evidence.\",\n    \"human_object\": \"Set strategic priorities, minimum diversification, and final reallocation authority.\",\n    \"stop_authority\": \"Portfolio owner may stop bets on precommitted evidence failure.\",\n    \"durable_learning\": \"Update evidence correlations, bet-specific learning rates, reversibility estimates, and future budget weights.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"n13\",\n    \"binding_constraint\": \"The issue is isolated, low-value, and has no recurrence evidence.\",\n    \"first_action\": \"Solicit a minimal correction proposal and a falsifier checking whether recurrence or broader impact exists.\",\n    \"machine_work\": \"Apply the typo fix, run a targeted diff and reference check, and inspect only directly relevant occurrences.\",\n    \"selector\": \"Clear against available evidence; execute the smallest bounded correction and assign no systemic budget unless recurrence appears.\",\n    \"human_object\": \"Confirm acceptance of the isolated edit.\",\n    \"stop_authority\": \"Task owner may stop after the targeted check passes.\",\n    \"durable_learning\": \"Record the correction and the absence of recurrence evidence; leave architecture unchanged.\"\n  }\n]"}}
